{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1229248046875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "ampicillin (IM or IV) and gentamicin for at least 2 days. After 2 days, the neonate",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.07305908203125,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "should be reassessed and treatment continued only if there are signs of sepsis (or a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        149.98292541503906,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "positive blood culture).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        101.14679718017578,
        274.4028015136719,
        115.0667953491211
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, Very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        117.41151428222656,
        399.0329895019531,
        130.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "The panel made this recommendation based on expert consensus as there was very",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        130.41151428222656,
        399.10302734375,
        143.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "low quality evidence that the intervention may prevent neonatal sepsis. There was no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        143.41151428222656,
        399.0729064941406,
        156.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "evidence available to evaluate harms and the risk of increasing antibiotic resistance,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        156.41151428222656,
        323.0628662109375,
        169.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "injection safety, and keeping a baby in hospital up to or for 5 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        180.9300079345703,
        231.48292541503906,
        192.92001342773438
      ],
      "text": "5.2.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        196.58470153808594,
        399.04266357421875,
        210.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "The Cochrane review included only two studies. There were no deaths reported in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        209.58470153808594,
        399.0628356933594,
        223.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "intervention or control groups in either of the studies. Similarly, one of the studies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        222.58470153808594,
        399.0727844238281,
        236.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "found no cases of sepsis in either of the groups. The quality of evidence from these",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        178.83920288085938,
        235.3647003173828,
        271.39923095703125,
        249.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        235.58470153808594,
        278.82720947265625,
        249.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "two single studies is very low ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        248.58470153808594,
        399.15142822265625,
        262.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "None of the infants who participated in the trials died in the neonatal period.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        261.5846862792969,
        399.0430603027344,
        275.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "One of the studies (Wolf, 1976) reported four cases of neonatal sepsis, all of which",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        274.5846862792969,
        399.07293701171875,
        288.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "occurred in the control (selective treatment) group. This difference was statistically",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        287.5846862792969,
        316.1528625488281,
        301.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "non-significant (49 participants, RR = 0.12, 95% CI 0.01 to 2.04).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        300.5846862792969,
        399.13134765625,
        314.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "Data are insufficient to provide evidence of a beneficial effect of immediate",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        313.5846862792969,
        399.1028747558594,
        327.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "prophylactic antibiotic compared to selective use of antibiotics on either neonatal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        326.5846862792969,
        399.0727844238281,
        340.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "mortality or on incidence of neonatal sepsis. The two trials were small and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        339.5846862792969,
        399.0728759765625,
        353.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "underpowered to detect any effect on the two outcomes of interest. The overall quality",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        352.5846862792969,
        151.5128936767578,
        366.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "of evidence is very low.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        377.10321044921875,
        163.95286560058594,
        389.09320068359375
      ],
      "text": "5.2.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        392.7478942871094,
        88.77290344238281,
        404.88787841796875
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        405.75787353515625,
        265.5029602050781,
        419.2478942871094
      ],
      "text": "The intervention is likely to prevent neonatal sepsis.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.2518005371094,
        78.65290069580078,
        439.39178466796875
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.26177978515625,
        231.96290588378906,
        453.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "No evidence is available to evaluate harms.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        464.7804260253906,
        207.81297302246094,
        476.7704162597656
      ],
      "text": "5.2.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        480.43499755859375,
        399.10284423828125,
        493.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "IM antibiotic administration should be possible in small hospitals. Median price",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        493.43499755859375,
        399.1327819824219,
        506.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "of ampicillin (250 mg) is US$ 0.18/vial and gentamicin (10mg/ml) is US$ 0.07/ml",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        506.43499755859375,
        364.76287841796875,
        519.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "making the cost of implementation affordable in most low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        529.9825439453125,
        283.0069274902344,
        543.1715698242188
      ],
      "text": "5.3\t Skin-to-skin contact in the first hour of life",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        546.6082763671875,
        399.052734375,
        560.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "Newborns without complications should be kept in skin to skin contact (SSC) with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        559.6082763671875,
        399.0728759765625,
        573.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "their mothers during the first hour after birth to prevent hypothermia and promote",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        572.6082763671875,
        113.64288330078125,
        586.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        588.0128784179688,
        264.8629150390625,
        601.932861328125
      ],
      "text": "(Standard recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        604.277587890625,
        399.0428161621094,
        617.767578125
      ],
      "text": "The panel made the recommendation based largely on expert consensus and put large",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        617.277587890625,
        399.10284423828125,
        630.767578125
      ],
      "text": "value on the expected benefits of skin-to-skin contact benefits on breastfeeding rates",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.60629272460938,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.43629455566406,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "24",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}